          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মাইনে (māine) is a loan, usually traced to Persian māhiyāna, \"monthly pay\". It is built on Persian māh, \"month\"."
